---
manual: element.sub
lines: [2093, 2094]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @p = para "Plain, then ", sub("fragment")
end
----------- test code
fragment = para("@p").contents.last

assert_instance_of Shoes::Sub, fragment, "sub returns a Shoes::Sub"
assert_equal "fragment", fragment.text, "holding the text it was given"
assert_equal "Plain, then fragment", para("@p").text, "as a fragment inside the text block"
